    "Consent is refused for the following works:\r\n• T1 (Sycamore) - Fell\r\n\r\nT1 provides good visual amenity value from the public domain, as it is clearly visible from Monkham’s Avenue. Furthermore, it also provides good habitat value, as it is a large and mature Sycamore.\r\n\r\nThe removal of T1 would affect the nature of the conservation area, and as there is no evidence of the apparent danger, we must refuse the proposed works."
